# Yescan Open Platform

> Yescan Open Platform (powered by Quark Scan) is an AI document-processing PaaS offering 36 capabilities across four domains — OCR (19), document scanning (13), format conversion (3), and AI ID photo generation (1). One unified Vision API endpoint covers all capabilities; developers switch behavior via `serviceOption` + `function_option` parameters.

Yescan is operated by the Quark Scan team under Alibaba Intelligent Information Business Group. It exposes the same AI stack that powers the consumer Quark Scan app (hundreds of millions of users) to B-side developers and enterprises. The platform supports 20+ languages for recognition and handles up to tens of millions of calls per day.

## Capabilities

- [OCR — 19 scenes](https://github.com/yescan-ai/yescan#文字识别-ocr19项): general text, handwritten text, tables, ID cards, business licenses, social-security cards, driver's licenses, vehicle licenses, VAT invoices, train tickets, HK/Macau/TW travel permits, degree certificates, math formulas, exam questions, overseas receipts, medical reports, drug reports, product images, image translation
- [Scan — 13 scenes](https://github.com/yescan-ai/yescan#文件扫描-scan13项): document scan, exam-paper enhancement, ID/receipt enhancement, handwriting removal, watermark removal, shadow removal, screen-moiré removal, image upscaling, background whitening, contract reorganization, sketch, line-art extraction, auto crop & deskew
- [Typeset — 3 scenes](https://github.com/yescan-ai/yescan#格式转换-typeset3项): image-to-Word (.docx), image-to-Excel (.xlsx), image-to-PDF (.pdf)
- [AIGC — 1 scene](https://github.com/yescan-ai/yescan#ai-证件照-aigc1项): AI ID photo generation with 9 makeup styles, 3 background colors, and adjustable clarity

## Integration Methods

- [API (recommended)](https://github.com/yescan-ai/yescan#方式一api-直接接入推荐): `POST https://scan-business.quark.cn/vision` with SHA3-256 signed requests — full control over all 36 capabilities
- [MCP server](https://github.com/yescan-ai/yescan#方式二mcp-协议接入): `https://scan-mcp.quark.cn/mcp?aiApiKey=<key>` — Streamable HTTP transport for Claude Code, Cursor, Cline, VSCode
- [OpenClaw / Agent Skill](https://github.com/yescan-ai/yescan#方式三skill-接入): three bundled skill packages covering all capabilities
- [CLI (`pip install yescan`)](https://github.com/yescan-ai/yescan#方式四cli-命令行接入): developer-friendly command-line tool for scripts and quick testing
- [Hermes Agent](https://github.com/yescan-ai/yescan#方式五hermes-agent-接入): conversational skill-package mode

